+  // No host depth clamp while the guest disabled clipping (only set on devices without depthClamp, e.g. older Arm
+  // Mali drivers): keep the depth inside [0, w] (w is clamped at 0 for vertices behind the eye) so the primitive is
+  // not clipped at the near or far plane. Per vertex rather than per fragment, which differs only inside primitives
+  // that cross a plane.
